---
import { portfolio } from "../../data/portfolio";
---

<section
  id="github"
  class="container-custom py-20 sm:py-24 lg:py-32"
>

  <div
    class="mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-3xl border border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/60 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-10 lg:p-14"
  >

    <!-- Heading -->

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">

      <span
        class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400 sm:text-sm"
      >
        OPEN SOURCE
      </span>

      <h2
        class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
      >
        Building in Public
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mx-auto mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-400 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8"
      >
        I actively document my Cloud & DevOps journey through GitHub
        repositories, Linux projects, automation scripts, networking
        notes, and infrastructure experiments. Every repository
        represents practical learning and continuous improvement.
      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Highlights -->

    <div
      class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3"
    >

      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">🐧</div>

        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          Linux for DevOps
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          Linux commands, shell scripting, LVM, networking,
          permissions, automation and mini DevOps projects.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">🌐</div>

        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          Computer Networking
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          Networking fundamentals including TCP/IP, DNS,
          HTTP, SSH, subnetting and OSI Model.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/60 p-6 transition duration-300 hover:border-cyan-400 hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        <div class="text-3xl">⚙️</div>

        <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white">
          Dev Portfolio
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          A modern developer portfolio built using Astro,
          Tailwind CSS and reusable components.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->

    <div class="mt-14 text-center">

      <a
        href={portfolio.github}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-cyan-500/20"
      >
        Visit My GitHub Profile

        <span class="transition-transform duration-300 hover:translate-x-1">
          ↗
        </span>

      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>